---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="How HalfCut works. A First Nations-led conservation model run from Sydney and Country."
  current="about"
  dark={true}
>
<!-- HERO -->
<section class="about-hero" data-screen-label="02 About · Hero">
  <div class="about-hero-bg" aria-hidden="true" data-parallax="0.15"></div>
  <div class="about-hero-veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="about-hero-inner">
    <h1>We're not the saviour.<br />We're the bridge.</h1>
    <div class="about-hero-bottom">
      <p class="lede">
        Since 2014 we've raised funds for rainforest restoration. We've been
        rebuilding ourselves around a harder, truer idea: that the people best
        placed to heal this Country are the ones who have known it for over
        65,000 years.
      </p>
      <p class="sidenote">
        This page is the public statement of a working principle. It sits
        beneath every decision we make, every campaign, every partnership,
        every dollar that moves through our accounts. We publish it here so
        you can hold us to it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MANIFESTO -->
<section class="manifesto-section" data-screen-label="02 About · Manifesto">
  <div class="wrap-sm">
    <h2>Half the world's<br>forests are gone.</h2>
    <p>Half of Australia's forests are gone.</p>
    <p>This is not a statistic. It's a warning.</p>
    <div class="callout">We have twelve years<br>to get this right.</div>
    <p>
      The science is settled and the window is narrow. What's not settled, what we believe is the real unfinished
      work of the Australian environmental sector, is who gets to lead the response.
    </p>
    <p class="indent">
      For two centuries, the answer has been: experts, agencies, organisations like ours. That answer has produced the world we currently live in. It is time to try a different one.
    </p>
    <p>
      The people who have cared for this continent for sixty thousand years still hold the knowledge. They still hold the authority. What they have often not held is the resources, the platform, or the power to act at the scale their knowledge deserves. HalfCut exists to change that, not by adding our voice to theirs, but by getting out of the way and making sure the resources land where they always should have.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- VALUES -->
<section class="values" data-screen-label="02 About · Values">
  <div class="values-head">
    <h2 class="reveal">What we<br>stand for.</h2>
    <p class="reveal">
      Four commitments. They sit above every other decision we make, and they do not flex for convenience, partner pressure, or funding opportunity. If a program, a campaign, or a partnership conflicts with one of these, the commitment wins.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="values-grid">
    <div class="value">
      <h3>Country comes<br>first.</h3>
      <p>The forests, the water, the species, the systems. They are not a backdrop. They are the reason we exist, and they are the measure of everything we do.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value">
      <h3>Traditional<br>Owners lead.</h3>
      <p>On the ground, in the governance, in the language. Our job is to resource and amplify, not to represent, translate, or speak over.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value">
      <h3>Money moves<br>honestly.</h3>
      <p>Ninety-two cents in every dollar flows to on-Country work. Every figure published here is independently audited. No soft accounting.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="value">
      <h3>We say the<br>hard thing.</h3>
      <p>The mission is too urgent for careful language. If a partner, a practice, or an idea is not working, we will say so, in public, plainly.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PARTNERSHIP FRAMEWORK -->
<section class="framework" data-screen-label="02 About · Framework">
  <div class="framework-head">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 24px;">Who we'll<br>work with. Who<br>we won't.</h2>
    <p>
      Every corporate partner we carry on this site has been assessed against the same values framework Traditional Owner partners assess us against. We publish both lists because opacity is its own kind of saviour behaviour.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="framework-cols">
    <div class="fw-col yes">
      <h3>We say yes to</h3>
      <h4>Values-aligned, long-horizon partners.</h4>
      <div class="fw-list">
        <div class="fw-line">Businesses whose core model is compatible with the world we are trying to restore.</div>
        <div class="fw-line">Organisations prepared to fund operational capacity, not just campaign visibility.</div>
        <div class="fw-line">Philanthropists willing to defer to Traditional Owner governance on program decisions.</div>
        <div class="fw-line">Partners who treat this as a twelve-year relationship, not a twelve-month activation.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="fw-col">
      <h3>We say no to</h3>
      <h4>Extraction, greenwash, or saviour framing.</h4>
      <div class="fw-list">
        <div class="fw-line">Fossil fuels, native forest logging, industrial agribusiness at scale.</div>
        <div class="fw-line">Funding that is conditional on creative control, brand placement, or narrative direction.</div>
        <div class="fw-line">Partnerships that ask Traditional Owner partners to perform culture or language for marketing.</div>
        <div class="fw-line">One-off offset arrangements that treat restoration as a carbon accounting line item.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PARTNERSHIPS CTA -->
<section class="partners" data-screen-label="02 About · Partnerships">
  <div class="partners-head">
    <h3>A short list<br />by design.</h3>
    <p>
      Every partner is assessed against the framework above and confirmed in
      writing. Rather than a wall of unverified logos, our verified partner
      list lives on the Partners page, and organisations join through The
      HalfCut Canopy.
    </p>
    <div class="partners-ctas">
      <a href="/partners" class="btn btn-primary btn-xl">See verified partners</a>
      <a href="/canopy" class="btn btn-xl btn-secondary">Join The HalfCut Canopy</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ACKNOWLEDGEMENT -->
<section class="acknowledgement" data-screen-label="02 About · Acknowledgement">
  <div class="wrap-sm">
    <p>
      We acknowledge the Eastern Kuku Yalanji people as the Traditional Owners of the Country on which our core restoration work takes place, and the Gadigal and Bundjalung people of the Country on which we meet, plan, and publish.
    </p>
    <p>
      We pay respects to Elders past and present, and we recognise that sovereignty was never ceded. This always was, and always will be, Aboriginal land.
    </p>
    <p class="sig">The HalfCut team &amp; Board</p>
  </div>
</section>



</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
.about-hero {
    padding: var(--hero-pad-top) var(--pad-x) var(--hero-pad-bottom);
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--cream);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .about-hero-bg {
    position: absolute; inset: -10% 0;
    background-image: url('/photos/photo_047.webp');
    background-size: cover; background-position: center;
    filter: brightness(.5) saturate(.9);
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .about-hero-veil {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(19,20,14,.35) 0%, rgba(19,20,14,.25) 40%, rgba(19,20,14,.85) 100%);
  }
  .about-hero-inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .accent { color: var(--acid); }
  .about-hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: clamp(56px, 8vw, 160px);
    line-height: .9;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    max-width: 18ch;
    text-wrap: balance;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .about-hero-bottom {
    margin-top: var(--s-8);
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--s-8);
    padding-top: var(--s-6);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--cream-15);
  }
  .about-hero-bottom .lede {
    max-width: 44ch;
    font-family: var(--f-serif); font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1.5vw, 22px); line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--cream); opacity: .9;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .about-hero-bottom .sidenote {
    font-family: var(--f-sans); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .04em;
    line-height: 1.6; opacity: .55; max-width: 36ch;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .about-hero-bottom { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  /* Long-form manifesto */
  .manifesto-section {
    padding: var(--s-11) var(--pad-x);
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--cream);
  }
  .manifesto-section .wrap-sm { max-width: 920px; padding: 0; }
  .manifesto-section .eyebrow { color: var(--acid); margin-bottom: var(--s-6); display: block; }
  .manifesto-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 96px);
    line-height: .92;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: var(--s-8);
  }
  .manifesto-section p {
    font-family: var(--f-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2vw, 30px);
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin-bottom: var(--s-5);
    max-width: 58ch;
  }
  .manifesto-section p.indent { padding-left: var(--s-8); border-left: 2px solid var(--acid);  }
  .manifesto-section .callout {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: clamp(48px, 5.5vw, 88px);
    line-height: .95;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--acid);
    margin: var(--s-8) 0;
    max-width: 16ch;
  }

  /* Values grid */
  .values {
    padding: var(--s-11) var(--pad-x);
    background: var(--cream);
  }
  .values-head {
    max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto var(--s-9);
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--s-8); align-items: end;
  }
  .values-head h2 {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: clamp(56px, 7vw, 120px);
    line-height: .9;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .values-head p {
    font-family: var(--f-serif); font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 46ch;
  }
  .values-grid {
    max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-15);
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    counter-reset: val;
  }
  .value {
    counter-increment: val;
    padding: var(--s-7) var(--s-5) var(--s-7) 0;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--ink-15);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink-15);
    position: relative;
  }
  .value:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .value::before {
    content: counter(val, decimal-leading-zero);
    font-family: var(--f-sans); font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .18em;
    padding-left: var(--s-5);
    display: block; margin-bottom: var(--s-6);
    opacity: .4;
  }
  .value h3 {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: .95;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding-left: var(--s-5);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .value p {
    font-family: var(--f-serif); font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;
    padding-left: var(--s-5);
    max-width: 30ch;
    opacity: .75;
  }

  /* Partnership framework */
  .framework {
    background: var(--stone);
    padding: var(--s-11) var(--pad-x);
  }
  .framework-head { max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto var(--s-8); }
  .framework-head h2 {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: clamp(56px, 7vw, 120px);
    line-height: .9;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    max-width: 20ch;
  }
  .framework-head p { font-family: var(--f-serif); font-weight: 300; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 56ch; margin-top: var(--s-5); }

  .framework-cols {
    max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2px;
    background: var(--ink-15);
  }
  .fw-col { background: var(--stone); padding: var(--s-7); }
  .fw-col.yes { background: var(--acid); }
  .fw-col h3 {
    font-family: var(--f-sans); font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: var(--s-5);
  }
  .fw-col h4 {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: clamp(40px, 4.5vw, 72px);
    line-height: .92;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: var(--s-6);
  }
  .fw-list {
    list-style: none; padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-15);
  }
  .fw-list .fw-line {
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink-15);
    font-family: var(--f-serif); font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.4;
    display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-start;
  }
  

  /* Partners */
  .partners {
    padding: var(--s-10) var(--pad-x);
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .partners-head {
    max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s-5);
    text-align: center; align-items: center;
  }
  .partners-head h3 {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 80px);
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: .95;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .partners-head p {
    font-family: var(--f-serif); font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.4vw, 20px); line-height: 1.55;
    opacity: .8; max-width: 56ch; margin: 0;
  }
  .partners-ctas {
    display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;
    margin-top: var(--s-4);
  }
  .partners-grid {
    max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink-15);
  }
  .partner {
    aspect-ratio: 2 / 1;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: .02em;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--ink-15);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink-15);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: .6;
    transition: opacity .2s, background .2s;
  }
  .partner:hover { opacity: 1; background: var(--stone); }
  .partner:nth-child(6n) { border-right: 0; }

  /* Acknowledgement */
  .acknowledgement {
    padding: var(--s-11) var(--pad-x);
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--cream);
    position: relative;
  }
  .acknowledgement .wrap-sm { max-width: 920px; padding: 0 var(--pad-x); margin: 0 auto; }
  .acknowledgement .eyebrow { color: var(--acid); margin-bottom: var(--s-6); display: block; }
  .acknowledgement p {
    font-family: var(--f-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.4vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    text-wrap: pretty;
    margin-bottom: var(--s-5);
  }
  .acknowledgement p.sig {
    font-family: var(--f-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: .5;
    margin-top: var(--s-7);
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .about-hero { padding: var(--hero-pad-top) var(--pad-x) var(--hero-pad-bottom-sm); }
    .about-hero-bottom, .values-head, .framework-cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--s-6); }
    .values-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .value:nth-child(2n) { border-right: 0; }
    .partners-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
    .partner:nth-child(6n) { border-right: 1px solid var(--ink-15); }
    .partner:nth-child(3n) { border-right: 0; }
  }
</style>
